{"t":"Zao Mountain","s":"zao-mountain-37de1","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Kito_9d157c.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Zao Mountain</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lazaran\">Lazaran</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/unnatural-selection-quest\">Unnatural Selection Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.54<br/>December 9, 2009<br/>Christmas Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Zao Mountain</b> is a mountain dividing <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a> from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Steppe\">Zao Steppe</a> and is located on top of <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a>. It is housed by a primitive tribe living in caves, thus Cavemen, which are led by <a href=\"#/wiki/Lazaran\">Lazaran</a>. They all have the Barbarian Outfits except for <a href=\"#/wiki/Ulala\">Ulala</a>, who has the shaman outfit because of her job as priestess. With the Summer Update 2012 one house was added to this location, the Caveman Shelter.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Zao Mountain NPCs (6 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kito\">Kito</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kito\"><img alt=\"Kito\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Kito_9d157c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Unknown Occupation</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Zao Mountain</strong>, up the ladder near <a href=\"#/wiki/Lazaran\">Lazaran</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lazaran\">Lazaran</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lazaran\"><img alt=\"Lazaran\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lazaran_c4c5fd.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Tribe Leader</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Zao Mountain</strong>, in a cave</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Makao\">Makao</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Makao\"><img alt=\"Makao\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Makao_bcc85a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Unknown Occupation</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: cen